      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor actively queried records and avoided definitive lab-dependent conclusions, which partially addressed ambiguous information. Completion is not awarded because the trajectory did not clearly integrate the known CT partial findings of right lower lung inflammation and bowel gas into symptom-triggered follow-up, nor explicitly distinguish normal head CT from unresolved toxicity risk.",
